{
  "name": "[DRAFT] Blog Agent 1: SEO Strategist",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a1-trigger",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 */2 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-perplexity",
      "name": "Claude Brief Generation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [460, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "none",
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "x-api-key", "value": "{{ANTHROPIC_API_KEY}}" },
            { "name": "anthropic-version", "value": "2023-06-01" },
            { "name": "content-type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 600,\n  \"system\": \"You are an SEO strategist for Chronexa, an AI orchestration firm. You MUST write for the exact persona given — no substitutions. Topics must be specific, operational, and never about generic 'AI automation'. Avoid: client onboarding (already covered x4), generic workflow automation, vague AI trends. Good angles: cost quantification, compliance risk, vendor consolidation, reporting bottlenecks, document processing, data reconciliation, RevOps gaps, audit preparation, capacity planning, error rates from manual work.\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Generate ONE SEO blog post brief for Chronexa.\\n\\nMANDATORY PERSONA: {{ ['wealth_management','supply_chain','saas_founder','agency_owner','cpa_firm'][Math.floor(Date.now()/(2*60*60*1000))%5] }}\\nYou MUST output this exact value in the %%PERSONA%% field. Do not use any other persona.\\n\\nPick a SPECIFIC operational pain point for this persona that:\\n- Is NOT about client onboarding\\n- Has clear financial impact (time saved, errors reduced, cost cut)\\n- A mid-market operations team would google\\n\\nReturn EXACTLY this format, no extra text:\\n\\n%%TITLE%%\\n<SEO title 60-65 chars>\\n%%KEYWORD%%\\n<primary keyword 2-4 words>\\n%%SECONDARY%%\\n<3-5 related terms comma separated>\\n%%PERSONA%%\\n<must match the mandatory persona above>\\n%%THESIS%%\\n<core argument 1-2 sentences with a specific stat or dollar figure>\\n%%END%%\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": { "timeout": 30000 }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-parse-brief",
      "name": "Parse Brief Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [680, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "p1-title",
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ $json.content[0].text.split('%%TITLE%%')[1].split('%%KEYWORD%%')[0].trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p1-keyword",
              "name": "target_keyword",
              "value": "={{ $json.content[0].text.split('%%KEYWORD%%')[1].split('%%SECONDARY%%')[0].trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p1-secondary",
              "name": "secondary_keywords",
              "value": "={{ $json.content[0].text.split('%%SECONDARY%%')[1].split('%%PERSONA%%')[0].trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p1-persona",
              "name": "persona",
              "value": "={{ $json.content[0].text.split('%%PERSONA%%')[1].split('%%THESIS%%')[0].trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p1-thesis",
              "name": "thesis",
              "value": "={{ $json.content[0].text.split('%%THESIS%%')[1].split('%%END%%')[0].trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-create-record",
      "name": "Create Pipeline Record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [900, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "appDyvRC1mKQO6mMJ",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "tblEKgg9T1Z8tsj55",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Title": "={{ $json.title }}",
            "Slug": "={{ $json.title.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g, '-').replace(/(^-|-$)/g, '') }}",
            "Status": "idea_generated",
            "Target Keyword": "={{ $json.target_keyword }}",
            "Secondary Keywords": "={{ $json.secondary_keywords }}",
            "Persona": "={{ $json.persona }}",
            "Thesis": "={{ $json.thesis }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "airtableTokenApi": {
          "id": "dKOWpUaGvyy1S0eM",
          "name": "Airtable Personal Access Token account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-sticky",
      "name": "⚙️ Agent 1: SEO Strategist",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 160],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Blog Agent 1: SEO Strategist v4\n\n**Trigger:** Every 2 hours (12 briefs/day)\n**Output:** 1 new blog brief → Airtable blog_pipeline (status = idea_generated)\n\n**Model:** Claude Haiku (Anthropic API)\n**Persona rotation:** time-slot based — slot % 5 maps to:\n  0=wealth_management, 1=supply_chain, 2=saas_founder, 3=agency_owner, 4=cpa_firm\n\n**v4 Changes:**\n- Fixed persona bias: time-based rotation enforces all 5 personas equally\n- Banned topics: client onboarding (already 4x), generic AI workflow automation\n- Forced specific angle: cost/error/compliance/reporting/data pain points",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 420
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Schedule Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Claude Brief Generation", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Claude Brief Generation": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Parse Brief Fields", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Parse Brief Fields": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Create Pipeline Record", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveManualExecutions": true,
    "errorWorkflow": "MKBhIfmRNZtPDJg0"
  },
  "tags": ["blog-pipeline"]
}
